{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Japanana 是一款專為日語學習者而設的文法練習 App，內容針對 N3 與 N4 程度劃分單元，適合準備 JLPT 考試、希望打好書面與會話基礎的學習者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-94.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>分級文法互動練習</h2>\n<p>內容按文法主題分門別類，方便針對書寫與日常對話所需重點研習。單元以互動講課形式拆解複雜概念，配合例句與常見使用情境，讓文法在真實語境中紮根。練習可選擇隨機出題，或集中處理較感困難的卡片，配合直覺易用介面，學習節奏由自己掌握。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-536-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-537-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-538-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-539-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-540-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Japanana – Japanese Grammar</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/japanana-japanese-grammar/id6476447175?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T17:00:36.034082+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":287,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T16:54:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T21:18:28.541427+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T16:58:21.902104+00:00","content_hash":"4fe31df52f2148349395186ade309eb082e81505704e4a7cd200f69769a5caaa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}